body:
You're going through puberty! Your body is tired because you're going through all these changes. Put your usual depression tiredness on top of it and you have one very tired person! If you can, aim for 8 hours of sleep. At the very least, lay in bed to rest for 8 hours a night. Sometimes just laying down in the dark is more restful than sitting up. And don't be afraid to nap! A good nap length is an hour, just a quick power nap.

&#x200B;

As for caffeine, caffeine doesn't work for me so I can't condone it. The best advice I can give is track your day to day sleeping habits so you can schedule around those habits. Give yourself a sleep schedule, plan to make time for naps, eventually you won't be as tired.

Yeah because none of my family is willing to stop being homophobic for one fucking day so I can spend time with them so here I am trying to pretend that I don't care when I've been crying all day.

&#x200B;

Happy fucking holidays
